  Bolivian government provides financial  aid for quinoa farmers and offers  courses on how quinoa can be used in  foods we had no idea that quinoa was  such a healthy plant we used to sell all  the quinoa we harvested and we'd eat  noodles instead now we won't eat  anything else we use quinoa in soups  juice bread and pastries you can use it  in almost anything estamos haciendo de  la king  and the increased production of quinoa  has helped many farmers improve their  standard of living  you  you
 

